## 🔒 Aisle Security Analysis

We found **3** potential security issue(s) in this PR:

| # | Severity | Title |
|---|----------|-------|
| 1 | 🟡 Medium | Global Claude live-session pool allows cross-tenant process exhaustion (DoS) |
| 2 | 🟡 Medium | Race condition can spawn duplicate Claude live-session processes for same key |
